Az Agent főoldaláról (Integrations, Agent chat stb.) kiindulva egy olyan SPA-szerű “agent page”-t érdemes építeni, ahol bal oldalt az integrációk / státusz, jobb oldalt pedig a chat és a “build”/”preview” rész jelenik meg. Az alábbi kód egy folytatás / továbbépítés lehet az `index8.html`-hez, ami ezt a Replit-szerű elrendezést utánozza.[1][2][3]

## Agent főoldal layout

- Bal oldali **sidebar**: Replit managed integrációk listája, Git providerek státusza.  
- Jobb oldalon felső **header**: “New chat with Agent”, gyors akció gombok (Check my app for bugs, Add payment processing stb.).[4][1]
- Jobb oldalon alsó rész: chat history, “Build” szekció, preview placeholder (ha nincs preview).[2]

```html
<!-- index8.html folytatás / továbbépítés -->
<section class="agent-page">
  <!-- Bal oldali integrációs panel -->
  <aside class="agent-sidebar">
    <header class="sidebar-header">
      <h2>Integrations</h2>
      <button class="btn-secondary small">Request an integration</button>
    </header>

    <div class="sidebar-block">
      <h3>Replit managed</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        These are built-in integrations that work automatically. Create an app and your agent can start using these right away.
      </p>
      <table class="integration-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Name</th>
            <th>Type</th>
            <th></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Replit Database</td>
            <td>PostgreSQL</td>
            <td>Open</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Replit App Storage</td>
            <td>Object Storage</td>
            <td>Open</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Replit Auth</td>
            <td>Authentication</td>
            <td>Open</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Replit Domains</td>
            <td>Domains</td>
            <td>Open</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-block">
      <h3>Git Providers</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        Connect your git provider to push, pull, and sync code via the Git pane. Not accessible to Replit Agent.
      </p>
      <ul class="git-list">
        <li class="git-item">
          <span class="git-icon bitbucket"></span>
          <span class="git-name">Bitbucket</span>
          <button class="btn-tertiary small">Sign in</button>
        </li>
        <li class="git-item">
          <span class="git-icon github"></span>
          <span class="git-name">GitHub</span>
          <button class="btn-tertiary small">Sign in</button>
        </li>
        <li class="git-item">
          <span class="git-icon gitlab"></span>
          <span class="git-name">GitLab</span>
          <button class="btn-tertiary small">Sign in</button>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Jobb oldali Agent chat + build terület -->
  <main class="agent-main">
    <!-- Felső header: plan / usage -->
    <header class="agent-main-header">
      <div class="plan-info">
        <span class="badge">Your Starter Plan</span>
        <div class="plan-metrics">
          <span>Free Apps <strong>5/10</strong> created</span>
          <span>Agent credits <strong>0% used</strong></span>
          <span>Cloud credits <strong>0% used</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-actions">
        <button class="btn-primary">Upgrade to Replit Core</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Agent chat “hero” rész -->
    <section class="agent-hero">
      <div class="agent-hero-text">
        <h1>Agent</h1>
        <p class="muted">
          New chat with Agent. Agent can make changes, review its work, and debug itself automatically.
        </p>
        <div class="agent-quick-actions">
          <button class="pill-btn">Check my app for bugs</button>
          <button class="pill-btn">Add payment processing</button>
          <button class="pill-btn">Connect with an AI Assistant</button>
          <button class="pill-btn">Add SMS message sending</button>
          <button class="pill-btn">Add a database</button>
          <button class="pill-btn">Add authenticated user login</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-hero-meta">
        <button class="btn-secondary">New chat</button>
        <button class="btn-tertiary">View history</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Chat + Build layout -->
    <section class="agent-workspace">
      <div class="agent-chat-pane">
        <header class="pane-header">
          <span class="pane-title">Chat</span>
          <span class="chip chip-build">Build mode</span>
        </header>

        <div class="chat-history">
          <div class="chat-system-msg">
            <span class="chip chip-system">System</span>
            <p class="muted">Scroll to latest</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Példa üzenetek -->
          <div class="chat-message user">
            <div class="avatar user-avatar">U</div>
            <div class="bubble">
              <p>Check my app for bugs.</p>
              <span class="timestamp">Just now</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chat-message agent">
            <div class="avatar agent-avatar">A</div>
            <div class="bubble">
              <p>
                Sure! I will scan your project, run tests where available, and report any errors or warnings. Then I’ll propose concrete fixes.
              </p>
              <span class="timestamp">Just now</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="chat-input">
          <textarea
            placeholder="Describe what you want Agent to do. For example: “Check my app for bugs and optimize the homepage for mobile.”"
          ></textarea>
          <div class="chat-input-footer">
            <div class="input-left">
              <button type="button" class="icon-btn" title="Attach file">
                📎
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="icon-btn" title="Insert URL">
                🔗
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="input-right">
              <button type="button" class="btn-tertiary small">Plan mode</button>
              <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Build</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="agent-build-pane">
        <header class="pane-header">
          <span class="pane-title">Build</span>
          <span class="muted">Make lightweight changes, quickly…</span>
        </header>

        <div class="build-placeholder">
          <div class="empty-state-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h2>Preview</h2>
          <p class="muted">
            Preview is not available. Run a build or select a different environment to see your app here.
          </p>
          <button class="btn-secondary">Run build</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</section>
```

### Egyszerű stílus (ha még nincs CSS-ed)

Ha nincs hozzá saját CSS-ed, egy minimál alap, hogy az elrendezés Replit-szerű, két hasábos legyen:

```html
<style>
  .agent-page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    background: #050816;
    color: #f9fafb;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  .agent-sidebar {
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #111827, #020617);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .agent-main {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .sidebar-block + .sidebar-block {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .integration-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .integration-table th,
  .integration-table td {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.4);
  }

  .integration-table th {
    text-align: left;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .muted {
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .git-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .git-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.25rem;
  }

  .git-name {
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .agent-main-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.7), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95));
  }

  .plan-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .plan-metrics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.6);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #e5e7eb;
  }

  .agent-hero {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95));
  }

  .agent-hero-text h1 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .agent-quick-actions {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .agent-hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .agent-workspace {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  .agent-chat-pane,
  .agent-build-pane {
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.7);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), rgba(2, 6, 23, 1));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .pane-header {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.5);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .pane-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .chip-build {
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12);
    color: #bbf7d0;
  }

  .chip-system {
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
    color: #bfdbfe;
  }

  .chat-history {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .chat-system-msg {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .chat-message {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .user-avatar {
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
  }

  .agent-avatar {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
  }

  .bubble {
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.6);
  }

  .chat-message.user .bubble {
    border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.7);
  }

  .timestamp {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .chat-input {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.5);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .chat-input textarea {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 80px;
    max-height: 180px;
    resize: vertical;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.9);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
    color: #e5e7eb;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .chat-input-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .icon-btn {
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: #9ca3af;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .agent-build-pane .build-placeholder {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1.75rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .empty-state-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .btn-primary,
  .btn-secondary,
  .btn-tertiary,
  .pill-btn {
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #f9fafb;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
    color: #e5e7eb;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
  }

  .btn-tertiary {
    background: transparent;
    color: #9ca3af;
    border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
  }

  .pill-btn {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
    color: #e5e7eb;
    border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
  }

  .small {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
  }

  .link {
    color: #60a5fa;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .agent-page {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .agent-sidebar {
      order: 2;
      border-right: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.7);
    }
    .agent-main {
      order: 1;
    }
    .agent-workspace {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
```

Ha megírod, hogy az `index8.html`-ben eddig pontosan mi van (fő layout, színek, tipográfia), át tudom igazítani ezt a blokkot, hogy pixelpontosabban illeszkedjen a mostani designodhoz.
